Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 23:05:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/14] local: drop the last upstream documentation links and
 the dead donation dialog

- the composer's formatting-help button and the magnet-link "torrent help" alert both linked
  to the upstream docs site; removed, along with the now unused url constants
- donation-dialog.tsx has not been rendered since the footer/heart de-branding, so it and its
  donate url are gone - this is what made join-lemmy.org finally disappear from the bundle
- reworded three comments that still named the upstream project or its translations repo,
  since comments ship inside the built files
